# PyTorch Model Checkpoints & Large Binary Weights
# Keep weights out of Git history to comply with GitHub size limits.
# Use Git LFS or host weights on GitHub Releases / Hugging Face Hub (see models/README.md).
*.pth
*.pt
*.bin
*.onnx

# Allow models directory documentation
!models/README.md

